title: VC_D1_01_Walter_Arrive
---
<<Walter Enter 1>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char1Cam>>
<<Walter Happy>>

//Walter greeting
Walter: Good evening.[waitfor=0.2/] It's been a long time since I last saw someone open something new in this town.
Walter: You must be the new face in town.
-> Welcome #timeout
    Player: Good evening, welcome to the bar.
    Player: Please, take your time and make yourself comfortable.
-> Honest
    Player: Yes, I just opened tonight.
    Player: Still trying to get used to how quiet this town is.
-> Friendly
    Player: Really? I thought I've been running this place since the 20th century.
    Walter: [wiggle]Haha... quite a talker.[/wiggle]
-> Formal
    Player: Welcome. It's a pleasure to have you as my first guest.

Walter: I'm Walter, by the way.
Player: Nice to meet you Mr. Walter.
Player: You can call me bartender.
Walter: Normally at this hour, I'd just be sitting in front of the TV.
Walter: [dangle]Old habits, I suppose.[/dangle]
Walter: But I saw a new place opening up, so I thought I'd drop by.
Walter: Wanted to see the new face in town for myself.
Player: Well, glad I opened the doors tonight.
Player: I'm sure this place will be better than TV.
Player: So, what will it be tonight?
