Walter: Anyway, officially... welcome to our little valley, Bartender.
Walter: We don't get many newcomers around here.
Walter: So, tell me. What's your first impression?
Walter: How do you like our quiet town so far?

-> It feels cozy. #timeout
-> A bit too quiet.
-> Good for sleeping.
-> Peaceful.

Walter: Fair enough.
Walter: But don't worry, people will start trickling in once word gets out.

