title: VC_D2_06_Cole_Eliana_Talk
---
<<Walter Look R>>
Walter: You two work together again, or just drink together?
Eliana: Both, unfortunately.
Cole: She handles the cases I bring in.
Walter: What's it about this time? Is it Owen trespassing on private property again?
<<Eliana Look L>>
Eliana: Nope. Wait, does he actually do that?
<<Walter Happy>>
