-> Joke about kids
    Player: Kids, huh. Always gotta test the waters eventually.
    Cole: ...
-> ...
    Player: ...
    Cole: ...
    Eliana: ...

Eliana: For what it's worth, she's not wrong for wanting it.
Eliana: And you're not wrong for worrying.
Eliana: You're just both bad at saying it out loud.
<<Cole Neutral>>
Cole: ...Noted, counselor.
Walter: She's got a point, son.
Cole: I said noted.
<<Walter Look F>>
<<Eliana Look F>>
